      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "So this isn't a bug, it's a limitation of discords rich presence system. The system in order to work fully and allow functionality such as the invite / request to join feature requires there to be a user count set and for it not to be full. So with us not wanting to leak instance details compromised on having it set the count to \"1 of 2\", it's not what we would like but it's what must be done to have everything work unfortunately.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
