  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Steps to reproduce:\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Join a private instance.\n\n3. Check your Discord profile.\n\n*If your status is invisible or your activity is private, it will not be visible.\n\nActual behavior:\n\nIt will always show \"1 of 2\" and will not sync with the number of people in the instance.\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nIn private instances, the number of people will be hidden and only your status will be displayed.",
